    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Vatne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100113816030809894616/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLoqKvLgd9AWXcNO2ZCPfS2lVDbEois-haLcAYKX68CjCzM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Company was happy to screw us over and yo-yo on their service. So far nothing and should be a nothing star rating.\n\nNice response from the online team, but the reality when you deal with this company by phone or to actually get the service you need is another story.  In this urgent and desperate time with the floods, you'd think they would want to do a better and smarter job.",
        "time": 1723663745,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kim Provost",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104659504290065092032/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwq3m_VMY8VhG1RkPZvR6qBITOakIzmcwtwpEH6wDJdBl4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Our experience was nothing but positive. Prior to our transaction I spoke to 2 different people who were both extremely pleasant, helpful and patient with all my questions and the price was in line with other quotes I received if anything slightly better. They searched our location via google maps to help us decide which size container would be best, they reassured us that the driveway would be protected and everything went just as planned. 3 days prior to pick I got a call asking if everything was ready for the scheduled date and everything went smooth. I would recommend this company without hesitation.",
        "time": 1633019352,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amanda Gay",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117563629559587958617/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNgnXUBatW7_1cj2yFxgNPlRzbIN5-TFGtc3YrMUFZ6kWw2Aad=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We hired Tyler and his team to connect our house to town sewage and we are blown away by their service! They took care of everything; the permit, coordinating with the plumber, town inspection and cleanup. It all happened quickly and easily. They were extremely professional and left the property looking better than it looked before! Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1683927584,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Artashes Toumanov",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115719456679644924958/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW3aVh_mNpLIAcfxL_pzx7imjXaSR3o3BdW4oBqRmqckfyPQM99bA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The service received for the last 2 years has been nothing short of stellar. Patrick has been super fast, efficient and friendly in communication and drivers are incredibly precise and punctual.",
        "time": 1706048464,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "B.E. Parson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102640758564430227957/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxI3digyEWc3DAtL1mKGpZEt0S2dX1fdjE7tTCTuu0dtQ_EIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I have lived in Hudson my entire life and have never had worse service from a company in my life. They took advantage of my wife and I during a difficult time. We are older and should have sought legal counsel - but we had little time or money and signed a very unfair contract. Now we have nothing and he refuses to finish the job until they get more money. He has cost us thousands of dollars that we didn’t have. My only hope is I can prevent this from happening to anyone else- do not use this terrible company.",
        "time": 1569691901,
        "translated": false
      }
